      "label": "Nazi German Military Uniform",
      "description": "The uniform and helmet worn by the soldier are characteristic of the German Wehrmacht or Waffen-SS during World War II. This visual is a direct reference to Nazi Germany and its association with genocide, racism, and totalitarianism. The image uses this visual to link the antisemitic stereotype to the historical atrocities committed by the Nazi regime.",
