      "description": "Antisemitism is a long-standing form of prejudice and discrimination against Jewish people, often rooted in conspiracy theories, religious stereotypes, and racial hatred. The meme leverages antisemitic tropes to spread hate by associating Jewish people with negative stereotypes and historical violence. This is a protected characteristic under hate crime laws.",
